-- Invisible helper creatures (bunnies, triggers, targets, credit markers, cameras) list a placeholder display (imp,
-- infernal, rabbit, rocket chicken or pug) next to their invisible stalker displays. Only creatures flagged as triggers
-- get the invisible display for players, and most helpers are not, so the server picked a display at random and players
-- saw about half of them as placeholders. Keep only the invisible displays. Infernal Attacker and Fel Imp Defender are
-- real creatures and keep their models.
